    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 07 April 2025, the existing use of 4 Crane Avenue, TW7 7JL as a small house in multiple occupation with no more than 6 occupants (Use Class C4) as shown on drawings submitted on 07 April 2025 and numbered Unnumbered Site Location Plan, Unnumbered Planning Statement, Unnumbered Tenancy Agreements and Bank Statements, Unnumbered Building Control Statements, S-01, HMO-6 is lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe existing use would comply with the requirements of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class L of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) and it has been demonstrated, on a balance of probability, that this use commenced prior to the Article 4 Direction coming into effect."
